            options: ["Focusing on the client's goals and the role the beliefs play, bracketing the counselor's views","Disclosing disagreement so that the client can decide whether to continue the work","Referring the client on the basis of the difference in religious beliefs","Debating the theology with the client to clarify the beliefs and their basis"],
